after some minutes working with X. The corruption never appears directly after
starting X, it takes several minutes to show up.

Restarting X hides the problem for a few minutes before the corruption
reappears.

DDX and libdrm are from git as of 08-Jan-2011.

I tried to use "EXAOptimizeMigration" "off" in xorg.conf, but this has no
effect.

